    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Story</u></h2>Based in New York, in 1949, the main character is Arthur Drake a detective who is a loner in his police force. One night Arthur discovers that his partner and sole friend is killed. By exploring the deeper details of this death, Arthur starts to come across cases that expand into an interconnected network of crimes. As Arthur, your job is to uncover the true reason for these deaths and get justice for the friend you lost. However, there is more than meets the eye to these crimes because the Greek Gods are at play. Throughout the game, the story takes a noir detective theme as well as incorporating Greek mythology. As Arthur discovers what the Gods have to do with these deaths he must face hard truths about his part to play in all of this.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Gameplay Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cast of four playable characters!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/4015f381d696243c76e7fe037b44a3ee.poster.avif?t=1749160709\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/4015f381d696243c76e7fe037b44a3ee.apng?t=1749160709\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/75e584bd766fd236dce9d7047d89a8ea.poster.avif?t=1749160709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/75e584bd766fd236dce9d7047d89a8ea.webm?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/4fdbe09a584a2bbbc855348b491aca67.poster.avif?t=1749160709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/4fdbe09a584a2bbbc855348b491aca67.webm?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/1ecac4d821bdcbc9ab983740219211b0.poster.avif?t=1749160709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/1ecac4d821bdcbc9ab983740219211b0.webm?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/1ecac4d821bdcbc9ab983740219211b0.mp4?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Challenging turn-based combat!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/38d56fd93885a5b0a9cbd9f51bc8a80c.poster.avif?t=1749160709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/38d56fd93885a5b0a9cbd9f51bc8a80c.webm?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923500/extras/38d56fd93885a5b0a9cbd9f51bc8a80c.mp4?t=1749160709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>5 Chapter campaign that will update and release over time.<br></li><li>A bond system that allows you to learn more details of NPCs the more you speak to them.<br></li><li>An open world with different regions of New York as well the Underworld.</li></ul>",
